  "question": {
    "text": "<p>One mole of an ideal monoatomic gas is subjected to changes as shown in the graph. The magnitude of the work done (by the system or on the system) is _______ J (nearest integer)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0094_27ddea2b65c0.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 275px;\" /><br /><br />Given : log 2 = 0.3, ln 10 = 2.3</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "620",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>1 to 2 ,&nbsp;Isobaric process<br />2 to 3,&nbsp;Isochoric process<br />3&nbsp;to 1, Isothermal process<br /><br />Using work under isobaric, isochoric and isothermal processes respectively:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>620</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
